OL,3,GNEWSAPatients unable to access GP
OL,4,Awebsites
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients have been alerted that their
OL,7,FGPs' websites are unavailable due to a
OL,8,F"technical issue" at a company that
OL,9,Fprovides the services.
OL,11,FGP practices in Gloucestershire are
OL,12,Faffected, with access to their websites
OL,13,Fand some online services disrupted. The
OL,14,Fcounty's NHS said it is not related to
OL,15,Fa cyber attack or data breach.
OL,17,FThe Willow Tree Surgery in Stonehouse
OL,18,Fsent an urgent message to patients
OL,19,Freminding them they can still use the
OL,20,FNHS App and order prescriptions by
OL,21,Fcalling the practice and leaving a
OL,22,Fvoicemail.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
