OL,3,GNEWSAPatients unable to access GP
OL,4,Awebsites
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for NHS Gloucestershire
OL,7,FICB said it is "working with practices
OL,8,Fand partners to resolve the issue as
OL,9,Fquickly as possible".
